#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_plot_suite_migration_guide.ipynb:60002
#: b6134c949d13417f9f41c030bcf10d1d
msgid "Non-Matplotlib Backends (not fully supported)"
msgstr "Backends distintos de Matplotlib (sin soporte completo)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_plot_suite_migration_guide.ipynb:60004
#: dd835c9b977040158776ed8e46425b33
msgid ""
"Any method that accepts `backend` can render with Plotly or Bokeh instead"
" of Matplotlib. When using a non-matplotlib backend you must pass "
"`return_as_pc=True`, which returns a `PlotCollection` instead of a "
"`(Figure, axes)` tuple."
msgstr ""
"Cualquier método que acepte `backend` puede renderizar con Plotly o Bokeh en"
" lugar de Matplotlib. Al usar un backend distinto de matplotlib, debe pasar "
"`return_as_pc=True`, lo que devuelve un `PlotCollection` en lugar de una "
"tupla `(Figure, axes)`."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_plot_suite_migration_guide.ipynb:60006
#: 317f5d2ec8ea49b7a2961f4d2a20e01a
msgid ""
"**Note:** Non-matplotlib backend support has not been fully tested and is"
" likely to contain issues. Use at your own risk."
msgstr ""
"**Nota:** El soporte para backends distintos de matplotlib no se ha probado "
"por completo y es probable que presente problemas. Úselo bajo su propio "
"riesgo."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_plot_suite_migration_guide.ipynb:60008
#: 47934686f74f4bcf8817cf22fa135022
msgid ""
"`waterfall()` in the decomposition namespace does not accept `backend` or"
" `return_as_pc` — it always returns a matplotlib `(Figure, axes)` tuple."
msgstr ""
"`waterfall()` en el espacio de nombres de descomposición no acepta `backend`"
" ni `return_as_pc` — siempre devuelve una tupla `(Figure, axes)` de "
"matplotlib."

